  m_text: "Lars-G\xF6ran is a very competitive individual from Dalarna, Sweden. He
    has a military background and was transformed by the horrors of war. Lars-G\xF6ran
    frequently tries to distract his opponents by calling them names or telling dark
    jokes during the race.\r\n\nSpecial effects:\r\nLars-G\xF6ran is decent at everything."
